qfappd (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: nDPI-based Application Control for QuartzFire.
    - Named actions with per-application / per-category allow-block verdicts.
    - Per-firewall-rule bindings via ct-mark ACTION_ID.
    - NFQUEUE classification with conntrack-mark fast-path offload.
    - gRPC introspection API + JSON event stream.

 -- QuartzFire <cwellman@quartz.systems>  Sat, 11 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
